// Title: Winscp Execution From Non Standard Folder
// Rule ID: 7674f8ef-7141-4cf0-a311-ee359264c64c
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.exfiltration, attack.t1048, detection.threat-hunting
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
